Now add CSS for `.sync-actions` and the dialog. Insert near `.sync-button` / after `.sync-status`. Let's add.

Styles:
```css
.sync-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px;
    margin: 14px 0 0;
}
```
Note `.sync-status` has margin-top 10px; fine.

Dialog styles after `.sync-status.is-error`.

```css
.categorize-dialog {
    width: min(940px, calc(100% - 28px));
    max-height: 88vh;
    padding: 0;
    color: var(--text);
    background: var(--white);
    border: 1px solid var(--beige);
    border-radius: 16px;
    box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(92, 75, 59, 0.25);
}

.categorize-dialog::backdrop {
    background: rgba(60, 48, 38, 0.45);
}

.categorize-panel {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 14px;
    max-height: 88vh;
    padding: 26px;
}

.categorize-panel h2 {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--deep-brown);
    font-size: 24px;
}

.categorize-panel > p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--brown);
}

.categorize-bulk {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    background: var(--ivory);
    border: 1px solid var(--beige);
    border-radius: 10px;
}

.categorize-bulk label {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    color: var(--deep-brown);
    font-size: 14px;
}

.categorize-bulk select,
.categorize-item select {
    padding: 6px 8px;
    color: var(--deep-brown);
    background: var(--white);
    border: 1px solid var(--sand);
    border-radius: 6px;
    font: inherit;
    font-size: 13px;
}

.categorize-bulk-apply {
    padding: 6px 12px;
    color: var(--white);
    background: var(--brown);
    border: 1px solid var(--brown);
    border-radius: 999px;
    font: inherit;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;
}

.categorize-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(150px, 1fr));
    gap: 14px;
    overflow-y: auto;
    padding: 4px;
}

.categorize-item {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 8px;
    background: var(--ivory);
    border: 1px solid var(--beige);
    border-radius: 10px;
}

.categorize-item img {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
    object-fit: cover;
    background: var(--cream);
    border-radius: 6px;
}

.categorize-name {
    overflow: hidden;
    color: var(--brown);
    font-size: 12px;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
    white-space: nowrap;
}

.categorize-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    gap: 10px;
}

.categorize-actions button {
    padding: 9px 18px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font: inherit;
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;
}

.categorize-cancel {
    color: var(--brown);
    background: var(--white);
    border: 1px solid var(--sand);
}

.categorize-save {
    color: var(--white);
    background: var(--brown);
    border: 1px solid var(--brown);
}

.categorize-cancel:hover,
.categorize-save:hover {
    filter: brightness(0.97);
}
```

Mobile: dialog padding smaller, grid min 130px. Add inside media query:
```css
    .categorize-panel { padding: 18px; }
    .categorize-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(120px, 1fr)); }
    .categorize-actions { justify-content: stretch; }
    .categorize-actions button { flex: 1; }
```

